ABU Books

Accounting and financial management system for ABU RAHMAN TRUCKING LLC.

Planned Features

- Bank of America transaction imports
- Secure bank-data connection
- Expense categorization
- Double-entry accounting
- Accounts receivable and customer invoices
- Profit and loss reports
- Bank reconciliation
- Employee permissions

Technology Plan

- Web application: Next.js
- Hosting: Vercel
- Database: Supabase PostgreSQL
- Currency: USD

Security

- Never store bank login credentials.
- Require authentication and role-based permissions.
- Review imported transactions before posting.
- Keep financial records separate from existing projects.

Development Status

Planning and initial setup. No live bank connection or production deployment.
